{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0ee361b3acf61aaec684f07353603c2fa188e06b095d3c062afdf1930a660ef5", "ja": "お疲れ様、瑞希。\nおお、よく似合ってるじゃないか。", "zh": "辛苦了，瑞希。\n哦，很适合你嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "2a4dd4e9bc9dee31749fc0d6a1a7f33bdc58e64098f28fbe3bf2aedddf0c5f9e", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nはい。私も、似合っていると思います。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n是的。我也觉得很适合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "29a39a27b3d0e9d71c83f56cbeadde109d4a3b710171ef8ed76aaa6d22c19779", "ja": "どこからどう見ても、立派なマジシャンです。\nではここで、マジックをひとつ……はっ！", "zh": "无论从哪里看，都是一位出色的魔术师。\n那么，就在这里表演一个魔术……哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "be3add191b52936169bff623266e5f6d2b0d1ccd60213c8c0a6e6538d1bd2c6d", "ja": "{$P$}。お願いがあります。\nジャケットの裏に、ポケットを追加できませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}。我有件事想拜托您。\n能不能在夹克内侧加个口袋？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1a1a46d2f78366e74f7695652fa35d350465dd904da7ab369225ddeb9a6cd3aa", "ja": "まだ調整できるから大丈夫だけど……\nジャケットの裏？", "zh": "现在还可以调整，所以没关系，不过……\n夹克的背面？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "8065b1ff243032c9a84ec2faa43feb463adb6dfb46aa32a700df8a35c41a8ba2", "ja": "はい。マジシャンにとって、\n袖の周りやポケットは大切な場所なのです。", "zh": "没错。对魔术师来说，袖口周围和口袋都是很重要的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "5c394ba3d9b1213f4be272c1f06ba95a0acaf20cdf0d37abe628151f79452964", "ja": "見えないところに、もうひとつポケットがあれば、\n手品の種類が増やせます。……よりどりみどり。", "zh": "如果在看不见的地方再有一个口袋，就能变更多种魔术了。……任君挑选。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f800cc3ff3d118bd7d1341f431cabcc97a14315e677c7b037df2c744bda88682", "ja": "そういえば、『聖ミリオン女学園』でも、\nその衣装でマジックを披露するんだったな。", "zh": "说起来，在《聖ミリオン女学園》里，也要穿着那套服装表演魔术来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "034c47b1cc146c9561237325235fa49cced0135a6e7523d4fd0944a982bbc017", "ja": "はい。マジックが好きで、いつもみんなに見せている\n生徒……正に、私のためにあるような役です。", "zh": "是的。喜欢魔术，总是表演给大家看的\n学生……简直就是为我量身打造的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "5a97342e7912f6379057460b568698b4320cf8a6cab81ff2ab22b2de473be772", "ja": "いつでもマジックが披露できるように、\n準備はバッチリだぞ。……アドリブもウェルカム。", "zh": "为了随时都能表演魔术，\n准备已经万无一失了哦。……即兴发挥也大欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "cc9b271d884ef7d54b2c2950cef56fd3671c1d7c886faa5ca100a632e32dc461", "ja": "それに、私のマジックには、姉妹を繋げる重要な役目が\nあると思います。特に、卒業パーティーのシーン……。", "zh": "而且，我觉得我的魔术还肩负着连接姐妹之间的重要使命。尤其是在毕业派对的场景里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "720c811a32be27e388a471854fead485ffa37d92b59544af924bb73dc441b6d0", "ja": "言葉がなくても、マジックで気持ちを伝える。\n……それが、私たち姉妹のコミュニケーションかと。", "zh": "即使不用言语，也能用魔术传达心情。……这应该就是我们姐妹间的交流方式吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4d7db895fe0c44a6774971ae049f3fcc1e3878f40e3e0ef455a6237266488e47", "ja": "なるほどな……よし、わかった。\nマジックがしやすいように調整してもらおう。", "zh": "原来如此……好，我明白了。\n那就请他们调整一下，让魔术更容易表演吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "14cb90e215d6f33bcfe307c092ad9aa36d593832463ab567c9ba682e121e58a5", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\nでは撮影までに、レパートリーを増やしておきます。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}。\n那在拍摄之前，我会多准备一些魔术节目的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "3b35bd1ff27c19f3eac09e06b0bb0b52c7dd26e56eaca91f70c0ecf2251d0aca", "ja": "徳川さんと望月さんは、どんなマジックが好きかな。\n……練習しがいがあるぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "德川小姐和望月小姐会喜欢什么样的魔术呢。\n……这下很有练习的价值了呢，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0254_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e654be6ce53259ee6886423b264d6f020f040e721cf311b7f0b685e5403630ba", "ja": "（瑞希のマジシャン魂に、火がついたようだ。\nどんなマジックを見せてくれるのか、楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（瑞希的魔术师之魂好像被点燃了。\n真期待她会展示怎样的魔术啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
